WEBVTT

00:05:30.236 --> 00:05:35.156
(Applause)

00:05:35.196 --> 00:05:40.556
Indeed, Africa has not
contributed enormously

00:05:40.596 --> 00:05:43.276
to the climate crisis.

00:05:43.316 --> 00:05:49.796
But we have visibly contributed enormously
to keeping the planet alive.

00:05:51.716 --> 00:05:52.876
We can, therefore ...

00:05:52.916 --> 00:05:56.236
(Applause)

00:05:57.116 --> 00:06:01.516
Not expect, but as the blind beggar,